cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Comprehensive Documentation Engineering (agent skill)"
message: "If you use this skill, please cite it as below, and cite Diátaxis separately per its colophon."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Courtney Robertson"
abstract: >-
  An agent skill that treats documentation as an engineering practice,
  synthesizing the Diátaxis framework with documentation auditing, information
  architecture, developer experience, governance, release testing, UI
  verification, evidence discipline, and security-safe reporting. Dual-licensed
  MIT AND CC-BY-SA-4.0 by file.
license: "MIT AND CC-BY-SA-4.0"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-20"
keywords:
  - documentation
  - diataxis
  - technical-writing
  - agent-skills
  - developer-experience
  - release-testing
  - documentation-audit
